# RidingVerse

RidingVerse is a Kotlin + Jetpack Compose Android app concept for a motorcycle group telemetry, navigation, and safety ecosystem.

## Included

- Moto-inspired dark cockpit dashboard
- Map route visualization with OpenStreetMap/Leaflet
- Squadron room overview
- Safety monitoring panel
- Android project skeleton with Jetpack Compose

## Run

Open the project in Android Studio and sync Gradle. Then run the `app` configuration on an emulator or physical device.

## Notes

This project is intentionally structured as a production-ready app foundation. The map uses a lightweight Leaflet-based WebView to keep the app compatible without requiring a Google Maps API key.
